 "description": "A fast text-mode web browser. From the menu it opens in a terminal window\non its start page, and Files opens web pages with it. In a shell (serial\nconsole or SSH), \"links <address>\" runs it in your own terminal.\n\nHTTPS goes through OpenSSL with Mozilla's list of certificate\nauthorities. Links keeps small caches so it fits in the badge's memory\nnext to other programs.",
